Version: 1.1
desc: Spin Doctor Ambisonic Rotator (SPARTA Rotator port) by chmaha
tags: spatial ambisonics rotation head-tracking hoa 3d
author: chmaha
changelog:
  Add full copyright and licence header (upstream authors' notices).
about:
  Rotates an ambisonic scene of 1st to 7th order with exact spherical-harmonic rotation matrices. Turn it by
  yaw, pitch and roll (in either order) or feed it a quaternion from a head tracker; whichever you moved last
  drives the rotation, as in the original. Changes cross-fade over 64 samples, so automation and tracker data
  stay click-free. ACN or FuMa input and output. Ported from SPARTA Rotator and the Spatial_Audio_Framework by
  Leo McCormack
  https://github.com/leomccormack/SPARTA (GPL-3.0), https://github.com/leomccormack/Spatial_Audio_Framework (ISC)
  JSFX version released under GPL-3.0 license
  Claude generated some of this code
